   1→{% comment %}
   2→  Pinzo — Theme App Extension Block
   3→  Add this block to any section in the Shopify Theme Editor.
   4→  The block automatically connects to your app — no manual configuration needed.
   5→{% endcomment %}
   6→
   7→{% if request.design_mode %}
   8→  {% comment %}
   9→    Theme Editor preview — shows two states:
  10→    1. If app embed is active → full widget preview
  11→    2. If app embed is NOT active → "Enable app embed" placeholder
  12→    We check window.__zccAppEnabled which is set by the app embed block.
  13→  {% endcomment %}
  14→  <div id="zcc-editor-{{ block.id }}">
